#: main.cpp:27
msgid "KDE's application finder"
msgstr "Pencari aplikasi KDE"

#: main.cpp:30
msgid "Install .desktop files into directory <dir>"
msgstr "Pasang fail ruang kerja ke direktori<dir>"

#: main.cpp:36 toplevel.cpp:48
msgid "KAppfinder"
msgstr "KAppfinder"

#: toplevel.cpp:51
msgid ""
"The application finder looks for legacy applications on your system and adds "
"them to the KDE menu system. Click 'Scan' to begin, select the desired "
"applications and then click 'Apply'."
msgstr ""
"Pencari aplikasi melihat kepada aplikasi legasi pada sistem anda dan tambah kepada menu "
"sistem KDE.Klik 'Imbas' untuk mula, dan pilih aplikasi yang diingini dan klik 'Terapkan'."

#: toplevel.cpp:61
msgid "Application"
msgstr "Aplikasi"

#: toplevel.cpp:62
msgid "Description"
msgstr "Huraian"

#: toplevel.cpp:63
msgid "Command"
msgstr "Arahan"

#: toplevel.cpp:71
msgid "Summary:"
msgstr "Ringkasan:"

#: toplevel.cpp:80
msgid "Unselect All"
msgstr "Nyahpilih Semua"

#: toplevel.cpp:86
msgid "Scan"
msgstr "Imbas"

#: toplevel.cpp:219
#, c-format
msgid ""
"_n: Summary: found %n application\n"
"Summary: found %n applications"
msgstr ""
"Ringkasan: temui %n aplikasi\n"
"Ringkasan: temui %n aplikasi-aplikasi"

#: toplevel.cpp:258
#, c-format
msgid ""
"_n: %n application was added to the KDE menu system.\n"
"%n applications were added to the KDE menu system."
msgstr ""
"%n aplikasi ditambah kepada menu sistem KDE.\n"
"%n aplikasi-aplikasi ditambah kepada menu sistem KDE."

